================
     About
================

SMPQ is StormLib MPQ archiving utility. It is utility for manipulating
Blizzard MPQ archives [1] which is using multiplatform C++ StormLib library [2].

Author: Pali Rohár <pali.rohar@gmail.com>
Version: 1.0
License: GNU GPL v3
Homepage: https://launchpad.net/smpq

================
  How to build
================

1. Download StormLib
2. Download CMake

$ mkdir -p build && cd build
$ cmake ..
$ make
$ sudo make install

================
   How to use
================

For detailed info see user manpage.



[1] - http://wiki.devklog.net/index.php?title=The_MoPaQ_Archive_Format
[2] - http://www.zezula.net/en/mpq/stormlib.html
